<import src="../../templates/status.wxml"/><view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">FITCREW · TODAY</view><view class="title">今天，照顾好自己</view><view class="subtitle">从一个小行动开始，慢慢认识身体。</view><template is="status" data="{{loading,error,busy}}"/><block wx:if="{{state}}"><view class="card" wx:if="{{state.onboarding.step &lt; 7}}"><view class="pill">开始前 · {{state.onboarding.step}} / 6</view><view wx:if="{{state.onboarding.step === 1}}"><view class="h2">慢慢认识自己的节律</view><view class="body">FitCrew 帮你记录生活方式与感受，不作医疗诊断。你可以随时停止实验、撤回记录或删除账号。</view><button bindtap="advanceOnboarding" disabled="{{busy}}">我已了解，继续</button></view><view wx:if="{{state.onboarding.step === 2}}"><view class="h2">选一个 90 天方向</view><button bindtap="openJourney">前往旅程选择</button><button bindtap="advanceOnboarding" disabled="{{busy || !state.journey}}">已保存方向，继续</button></view><view wx:if="{{state.onboarding.step === 3}}"><view class="h2">先了解数据用途</view><view class="body">手动记录用于你的私人趋势和实验比较。Apple 健康按类别另行授权。AI 需要单独同意，不会自动读取笔记或原始健康样本；记录不会自动分享到群聊。</view><button bindtap="advanceOnboarding" disabled="{{busy}}">已阅读用途，继续</button></view><view wx:if="{{state.onboarding.step === 4}}"><view class="h2">选择记录方式</view><view class="body">小程序不能直接读取 Apple 健康。先用手动记录，稍后可在 iOS App 查看健康授权。</view><button data-route="manual" bindtap="advanceOnboarding" disabled="{{busy}}">先用手动记录</button></view><view wx:if="{{state.onboarding.step === 5}}"><view class="h2">确认数据准备情况</view><view class="body">没有健康样本也可以继续。手动记录不会被标成已同步 Apple 健康。</view><button data-route="manual" bindtap="advanceOnboarding" disabled="{{busy}}">暂用手动记录，继续</button></view><view wx:if="{{state.onboarding.step === 6}}"><view class="h2">做一次 Body Check</view><button bindtap="openLog">记录此刻感受</button><button bindtap="advanceOnboarding" disabled="{{busy || !logs.length}}">已保存记录，完成引导</button></view><view class="small muted">确认后的进度保存在你的账号中，中断后可继续。</view></view><view class="card" wx:if="{{state.today_context}}"><view class="h2">{{state.today_context.title}}</view><view class="body">{{state.today_context.detail}}</view><view class="small muted">来源：{{state.today_context.source}} · {{state.today_context.window_start}} — {{state.today_context.window_end}}</view><button bindtap="openProfile">查看数据用途与授权</button></view><view class="card"><view class="h2">最近一次记录</view><view wx:if="{{logs.length}}" class="body">最近记录：{{logs[0].feeling}} · 精力 {{logs[0].energy}} / 5</view><view wx:else class="muted">还没有身体记录。你的第一条感受，会成为起点。</view><button bindtap="openLog">记录 Body Check</button></view><view class="card hero" wx:if="{{state.mission}}"><view class="pill">今天的一小步</view><view class="h2">{{state.mission.title}}</view><view class="body">{{state.mission.why}}</view><block wx:if="{{state.mission.status !== 'done' &amp;&amp; state.mission.status !== 'skipped'}}"><button class="primary" bindtap="mission" data-action="done" disabled="{{busy}}">我做到了</button><view class="row"><button bindtap="mission" data-action="lighten" disabled="{{busy}}">轻一点</button><button bindtap="mission" data-action="skip" disabled="{{busy}}">今天跳过</button></view></block><view wx:else class="pill">{{state.mission.status === 'done' ? '今日已完成' : '今天先休息'}}</view></view><view wx:else class="card hero"><view class="h2">选一个你在意的方向</view><view class="body">先设定旅程，再获得今天的行动。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="openJourney">开始我的旅程</button></view><view class="card"><view class="h2">下一次检查：{{state.next_check.title}}</view><view class="body">{{state.next_check.detail}}</view><button bindtap="openNextCheck">{{state.next_check.action === 'log' ? '记录此刻感受' : state.next_check.action === 'journey' ? '选择旅程' : '查看实验'}}</button></view></block><view wx:if="{{choosing}}" class="sheet-backdrop"><view class="card choice-sheet"><view class="h2">今天可以轻一点</view><view class="body">选择后保存；取消会保留原任务。</view><button wx:for="{{alternatives}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseLighten" disabled="{{busy}}">{{item.title}}</button><button bindtap="cancelLighten" disabled="{{busy}}">取消</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{state.mission.adjusted_at}}" class="small muted">调整已保存：{{state.mission.adjusted_at}} · 版本 {{state.mission.revision}}</view><view class="footer">生活方式记录与观察，不提供疾病诊断或治疗建议。</view></view>
